@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Kelola Laporan Catatan
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
boundary "UI_LaporanCatatan" as UI
control "Control_Laporan" as Control
entity "T_Laporan" as E_Laporan
entity "T_CatatanMonitoring" as E_Catatan

== Skenario: Menampilkan Dashboard Laporan & Catatan ==
Admin -> UI : 1. Mengakses Menu "Laporan & Catatan"
activate UI
UI --> Admin : 2. Menampilkan Sub-Menu (Laporan Terpadu & Riwayat Catatan)
deactivate UI

== Skenario A: Sub-Menu Laporan Terpadu ==
Admin -> UI : 3. Memilih "Laporan Terpadu"
activate UI
UI --> Admin : 4. Menampilkan Dasbor Laporan
Admin -> UI : 5. Menentukan Jenis Laporan & Filter Data
Admin -> UI : 6. Klik "Tampilkan" atau "Export"
UI -> Control : 7. RequestLaporan(Jenis, Filter)
activate Control

Control -> E_Laporan : 8. QueryDataLaporan(Jenis, Filter)
activate E_Laporan
E_Laporan --> Control : 9. HasilDataQuery()
deactivate E_Laporan

Control -> Control : 10. FormatData(Preview / PDF / Excel)
Control --> UI : 11. ReturnFileLaporan(File/Data)
deactivate Control
UI --> Admin : 12. Menampilkan Pratinjau atau File Unduhan
deactivate UI

== Skenario B: Sub-Menu Pengelolaan Catatan ==
Admin -> UI : 13. Memilih "Pengelolaan Catatan"
activate UI
UI -> Control : 14. RequestRiwayatCatatan()
activate Control
Control -> E_Catatan : 15. AmbilRiwayatCatatan()
activate E_Catatan
E_Catatan --> Control : 16. DataCatatan()
deactivate E_Catatan
Control --> UI : 17. TampilkanRiwayat(Data)
deactivate Control

alt Aksi = Kirim Catatan Baru
    Admin -> UI : 18. Klik "Buat Catatan Baru" & Mengisi Form
    Admin -> UI : 19. Menentukan Prioritas & Target Penerima
    Admin -> UI : 20. Klik "Kirim Catatan"
    UI -> Control : 21. SubmitCatatanBaru(Data, Target)
    activate Control

    Control -> E_Catatan : 22. InsertCatatan()
    activate E_Catatan
    deactivate E_Catatan
    note right of E_Catatan : Konvensi Assumed Success diterapkan

    Control -> Control : 23. Broadcast Notifikasi ke Target Penerima

    Control --> UI : 24. NotifikasiSukses()
    deactivate Control
    UI --> Admin : 25. Pesan Sukses (Catatan Terkirim)

else Aksi = Hapus Riwayat Catatan
    Admin -> UI : 26. Klik "Hapus" pada Catatan Lama
    UI -> Control : 27. ProsesHapusCatatan(ID_Catatan)
    activate Control
    Control -> E_Catatan : 28. DeleteCatatan()
    activate E_Catatan
    deactivate E_Catatan

    Control --> UI : 29. NotifikasiSukses()
    deactivate Control
    UI --> Admin : 30. Pesan Sukses (Catatan Dihapus)
end
deactivate UI

@enduml
